        "id": 1308504
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-02T14:58:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "See b/72981744 for bpf module type history that it run \"clang --target\u003dbpf\" and compile .c to .o\n\n+ Lorenzo to provide more context if needed.\n\nI don\u0027t know why not just use cc_*. Probably there are too many cflags and specific \"clang --target\u003dbpf\" and we do not what to specify them each time ?",
      "parentUuid": "f9274fb8_64e33c81",
      "revId": "3d861726104d89fa3af593a6dcde4a2a4f8ee208",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
